1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,830
Speaking, task three. Story number 20: Exam day. What did Andrij do on the day of the exam? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,667 --> 00:00:13,624
What did Andrij do on the day of the exam?

3
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:36,733
On the day of the exam Andrij got up early in the morning.

4
00:00:36,933 --> 00:00:40,033
He drank a coffee and went over his vocabulary once more.

5
00:00:40,233 --> 00:00:43,833
He was a bit nervous but confident, because he had studied for a long time.

6
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:46,200
Then he took the train to the language school.

7
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,300
The journey took forty minutes.

8
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,133
In the classroom he did the written test.

9
00:00:50,333 --> 00:00:53,100
First came reading, then writing and listening.

10
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,333
In the afternoon he had the oral exam.

11
00:00:55,533 --> 00:00:58,267
He talked with the examiner about work and family.

12
00:00:58,467 --> 00:01:01,900
At the end he was smiling, because he knew he had made it.

13
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:11,345
Tell story 20 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
